== H1 ==
H1a cold start (no native observation yet), threshold-only apply: REFUSED -> ValueError: Selected account is unready for execution; refresh its host status
H1b fresh observation, threshold-only apply: SAVED
   selected row after ageing: {'auth': 'signed_in', 'auth_stale': True} ready= False
H1c observation aged past TTL (301 s), threshold-only apply: REFUSED -> ValueError: Selected account is unready for execution; refresh its host status
H1d after a timed-out refresh, threshold-only apply: REFUSED -> ValueError: Selected account is unready for execution; refresh its host status
== H2 ==
H2a fresh catalog, save exact quality claude=balanced/high: SAVED
   catalog state after ageing: stale
H2b catalog aged past TTL, threshold-only apply (quality unchanged): REFUSED -> ValueError: Refresh native model capabilities before choosing an exact model or effort
== H3 ==
   before failure: provider_usage state=unsupported tokens=None observed_at set=True
   after timeout: provider_usage state=stale tokens=None error=timeout
   claude-default allowance after its own timeout earlier: state=unsupported windows=[]
